# {{PROJECT_NAME}}

Starter app for **North Embedded Checkout**, generated by `north-skills`.

```bash
npm install
# put your Sandbox credentials in .env.local
npm run dev
```

Open http://localhost:3000, add items, click **Checkout**, pay with a Sandbox test card.

| File | Job |
|------|-----|
| `lib/north/client.ts` | The only code that calls North (create session, session status) |
| `lib/north/payment.ts` | Decides "paid in full" (status + `auth_resp` + `auth_amount`) |
| `lib/north/webhook.ts` | Verifies the transaction webhook HMAC over raw bytes |
| `app/api/north/session` | Prices the cart on the server, creates the session |
| `app/api/north/verify` | Asks North what happened; the source of truth |
| `app/api/webhooks/north/transaction` | Second confirmation from North |
| `components/north/NorthCheckout.tsx` | Mounts North's hosted form |

Going further: ask your agent `/north-embedded-checkout <what you want>` or `/learn-north`.

**Before production:** replace the in-memory store in `lib/north/orders.ts` with a database, set the Checkout Designer Domain to your site's origin, and ask North to allowlist your webhook URL.
